  "notes": "Compatible immutable release packaging accepted provider action-index bridge PR #652 and resolved bounded issue #653 while advancing umbrella #432. The shared settlement boundary and Deuces Wild now resolve committed actions through the JSON action registry or MySQL unique index instead of million-row ledger scans, while preserving exact replay, conflict, lost-response, round, transaction-type, amount, and fingerprint validation. Permanent requirements remain exactly 933 after accepted LEDGER-033 and TEST-164; this release allocates no identifier. Frozen API envelopes, paytables, settlement timing, providers, restricted-preview policy, and the held MySQL migration policy remain unchanged. The legacy JSON action-journal format remains byte-compatible so exact immutable terminal-green v0.9.5.63 is a safe application-only predecessor; umbrella #432 stays open for the later append-only write transition. The canonical package inventory is exactly 744 regular files: the terminal v0.9.5.63 inventory plus this compatibility record, with repository documentation, tests, and engineering audit scripts intentionally excluded."
